    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/40cb7c4cebbb955a3f80611bb8e4544d.poster.avif?t=1682103808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/40cb7c4cebbb955a3f80611bb8e4544d.webm?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/40cb7c4cebbb955a3f80611bb8e4544d.mp4?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>HYPERHELL is a maximalist bullet hell roguelike featuring Fraxiom, Gupi and various hyperpop musicians.<br>Free, with no DLC or microtransactions.<br><br>Ronald Reagan has stolen Food House's fully stocked refrigerator, and it's up to them get it back. Travel through colorful cities in hell using a drill powered by demon blood to reach Satan's megamansion and reclaim your grub. <br><br>Use popstar powers + a huge arsenal of cartoonish weaponry to carve your way through a wide array of enemies and bosses. Play fast and aggressive using a momentum based movement style to keep up with your appetite.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/5cca76d86bd98dd89dc3bf257e6568a9.avif?t=1682103808\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as Fraxiom, Gupi, and other hyperpop musicians each with their own popstar powers<br></li><li>Dodge and carve through a variety of different enemy bullet types and patterns using a massive arsenal of goofy over-the-top weapons<br></li><li>Plunge deeper through the Murder City Megamall, SinCorp LLC Offices, and Satan's Megamansion<br></li><li>Outmaneuver your opponents on grind-rails and boost pads with ridiculous movement mechanics<br></li><li>Unlock new weapons and powerups for completing challenges, like the Rave Cannon and Trampoline Rifle<br></li><li>Looping system allowing high level players to continue runs endlessly<br></li><li>Fishing minigame</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/e66a446488c1e0c199bc61ee1b54363a.poster.avif?t=1682103808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/e66a446488c1e0c199bc61ee1b54363a.webm?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/e66a446488c1e0c199bc61ee1b54363a.mp4?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/40cb7c4cebbb955a3f80611bb8e4544d.poster.avif?t=1682103808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/40cb7c4cebbb955a3f80611bb8e4544d.webm?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/40cb7c4cebbb955a3f80611bb8e4544d.mp4?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>HYPERHELL is a maximalist bullet hell roguelike featuring Fraxiom, Gupi and various hyperpop musicians.<br>Free, with no DLC or microtransactions.<br><br>Ronald Reagan has stolen Food House's fully stocked refrigerator, and it's up to them get it back. Travel through colorful cities in hell using a drill powered by demon blood to reach Satan's megamansion and reclaim your grub. <br><br>Use popstar powers + a huge arsenal of cartoonish weaponry to carve your way through a wide array of enemies and bosses. Play fast and aggressive using a momentum based movement style to keep up with your appetite.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/5cca76d86bd98dd89dc3bf257e6568a9.avif?t=1682103808\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as Fraxiom, Gupi, and other hyperpop musicians each with their own popstar powers<br></li><li>Dodge and carve through a variety of different enemy bullet types and patterns using a massive arsenal of goofy over-the-top weapons<br></li><li>Plunge deeper through the Murder City Megamall, SinCorp LLC Offices, and Satan's Megamansion<br></li><li>Outmaneuver your opponents on grind-rails and boost pads with ridiculous movement mechanics<br></li><li>Unlock new weapons and powerups for completing challenges, like the Rave Cannon and Trampoline Rifle<br></li><li>Looping system allowing high level players to continue runs endlessly<br></li><li>Fishing minigame</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/e66a446488c1e0c199bc61ee1b54363a.poster.avif?t=1682103808\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/e66a446488c1e0c199bc61ee1b54363a.webm?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999940/extras/e66a446488c1e0c199bc61ee1b54363a.mp4?t=1682103808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
